#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man3/getgrent.3:108
msgid ""
"Upon error, I<errno> may be set.  If one wants to check I<errno> after the "
"call, it should be set to zero before the call."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man3/getgrent.3:117
