"The function B<getgrent_r>()  is not really reentrant since it shares the "
"reading position in the stream with all other threads."
msgstr ""

#. type: SH
#: build/C/man3/getgrent_r.3:188 build/C/man3/getgrouplist.3:109
#: build/C/man3/getpwent_r.3:189 build/C/man3/getpwnam.3:282
