msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man3/getspnam.3:253
msgid ""
"The include file I<E<lt>paths.hE<gt>> defines the constant B<_PATH_SHADOW> "
"to the pathname of the shadow password file."
msgstr ""

